  "prefLabel": "Pda 305.02 Pilot Requirements for Initial Appointment as Class I or II Pilot",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 305.02 Pilot Requirements for Initial Appointment as Class I or II Pilot. Any person seeking an initial appointment as a pilot shall:\n\n(a) Submit to the division a completed “Application for Initial Pilot Appointment” as described in Pda 306.01 including all required certifications; and\n\n(b) Meet the requirements set forth in Pda 305.06 and Pda 305.07.\n\nSource. #7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
